#: of
#: pysme.atmosphere.interpolation.AtmosphereInterpolator.spherical_model_correction:3
msgid ""
"If all interpolated models were spherical, the interpolated model should "
"also be reported as spherical. This enables spherical-symmetric radiative"
" transfer in the spectral synthesis."
msgstr ""

#: of
#: pysme.atmosphere.interpolation.AtmosphereInterpolator.spherical_model_correction:7
